  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, namespace URIs and schema URLs use fedora.info and (older) comm.nsdl.org.  Ideally, they all point to the same host, which is consistent with our groupId and java packaging structure, org.fcrepo (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fcrepo.org/etc)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fcrepo.org/etc)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We need to consider the impact of this and whether it's worth changing the formats in place.  Another alternative is to just decide that all future XML formats, etc, will use some new convention for the namespaceURI and schemaLocation, based at fcrepo.org.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[ Scope ]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "All XML schemas we publish.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "All WSDL we publish.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[ Impact ]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The FOXML format would need to be versioned.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other schemas' (method map, rest api responses, etc) would need to be versioned",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'd either need to provide the ability to use the old version and new version simultaneously, or a way to migrate from the old version.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
